              "heading": "ZX Bank Branches in Kolkata"
            },
            "text": "Kolkata, the cultural and financial hub of Eastern India, enjoys robust banking infrastructure supported by ZX Bank’s expanding network. To serve the diverse needs of individuals and businesses, ZX Bank has strategically distributed its branches across the city’s major regions—North, South, East, West, and Central Kolkata. This facilitates convenient access to retail, digital, and corporate banking services for residents, business owners, and visitors throughout the metropolitan area."
